[{"title":"杂兴六言十首 其六","author":"刘克庄","text":"小臣素著狂直，先皇数奖忠嘉。\n叩额有厚伦疏，断腕无起复麻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33428,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴六言十首 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"重来已白发老，独断擢紫薇郎。\n雅量虽惭子固，热情不倩君房。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33429,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴六言十首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"昔从西山授业，屡言后村当仁。\n伯纪盖同学子，履常真对掌人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33430,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴六言十首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"直翁寿甫踰八，叔方年不及希。\n即今高冢麟卧，何时华表鹤归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33431,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴六言十首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"史事十羊九牧，古音百鸟孤凰。\n前召南塘视草，后起秀岩提纲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33432,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂兴六言十首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"羹墙如见尧在，讴歌皆之启贤。\n至行冠冕万世，通丧缟素三年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33433,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂咏六言八首 其八","author":"刘克庄","text":"卢老数间破屋，张公九尺长身。\n容膝何妨啸傲，打头不敢欠伸