":"老病六言十首呈竹溪 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"射虱心法未亲，读蝇头字不真。\n顾我八十馀老，见公两三分人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33459,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老病六言十首呈竹溪 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"恰则垂髫两髧，俄然揽镜千丝。\n昧老聃守黑义，动墨子染白悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33460,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老病六言十首呈竹溪 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"存三四齿皆碎，落第二牙尤衰。\n渠能更斫鲸脍，何不姑食肉糜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33461,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耳鼻六言二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"一饥惯食腥腐，三嗅不分臭香。\n残质心灰已久，末年鼻壅何伤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33462,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"耳鼻六言二首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"万法与身俱幻，百骸惟耳尚聪。\n文公为补琴操，回仙邀听松风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33463,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"至人六言","author":"刘克庄","text":"幽子多栖白云，至人或混红尘。\n有时鼻涕择菜，有时丫髻负薪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33464,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"达生","author":"刘克庄","text":"无二客穿冢殉，有一奴荷锸从。\n勿烦作者谀墓，莫管邻人相舂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33465,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"两朝口号六言二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"宇宙包吾仁内，充之惟天惟尧。\n昊穹敬此一字，千载以待永昭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33466,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"两朝口号六言二首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"尧舜若稽古外，烈祖圣谟洋洋。\n道理一句最大，卓冠万世帝王。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33467,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余作生坟何生谦致桧十株答以六言二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"一奴荷锸足矣，二客穿冢谁哉。\n宰上又添十桧，庭前不必三槐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33468,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余作生坟何生谦致桧十株答以六言二首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"高耸心抽笔直，下蟠上锐塔圆。\n深入蛰龙穴处，肯傍眠牛石边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33469,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兑女余最小孙也慧而夭悼以六言二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"不合小时了了，可堪长夜茫茫。\n暮年欠汝泪债，已乾更滴数行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33470,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兑女余最小孙也慧而夭悼以六言二首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"性慧于灵照女，年小似善财童。\n急急之符夺汝，琅琅之音恼翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33471,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事六言四首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"早咏白驹在谷，晚驾青牛出关。\n宁为鱼点墨退，犹胜鹤带箭还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33472,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事六言四首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"骨已朽黄泉下，传犹列青史中。\n猛朴时来宰相，关张运去英雄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33473,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事六言四首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"有时眼花落井，有时鼻孔撩天。\n工诗只是少黠，说禅莫是大颠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33474,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事六言四首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"宦情为虎为鼠，世态如云如轮。\n武夫驾盲宰相，醉尉呵飞将军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33475,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀真赵二公一首","author":"刘克庄","text":"南塘清谈亹亹，西山至言琅琅。\n七略通群书博，一生短千载长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33476,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"抄近藁六言二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"东邻莫效西子，南窗何减北扉。\n一萤道我来往，焉用宫莲送归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33477,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"抄近藁六言二首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"和调失黏诗句，按摸出格文章。\n尽可追陪党进，不消更觅君房。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33478,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"村居即事六言十首 其十","author":"刘克庄","text":"敝缊袍足蔽体，恶草具可享宾。\n犊车荣过九锡，鲊饭甘于八珍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33479,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"村居即事六言十首 其九","author":"刘克庄","text":"发脱秃鹙无异，背伛橐驼逼真。\n不是进贤冠者，亦非灵寿杖人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33480,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"村居即事六言十首 其八","author":"刘克庄","text":"坐处在细旃上，立时傍红云边。\n宁罚公干磨石，可使刘陶铸钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33481,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"村居即事六言十首 其七","author":"刘克庄","text":"一把算未能下，万户棋苦不高。\n老子腹中无物，渠侬笑里有刀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33482,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"村居即事六言十首 其六","author":"刘克庄","text":"风窗有竹相敲，地炉无叶可烧。\n乱书翻覆未了，一灯明灭频挑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33483,"sha256":"18413bf73b9