:"宋"}},{"title":"纵笔六言七首 其六","author":"刘克庄","text":"精卫衔石填海，醯鸡以瓮为天。\n拊石凤翔千仞，□□龙沕九渊。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33490,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纵笔六言七首 其五","author":"刘克庄","text":"佛经六千馀卷，聃书八十一篇。\n今为二氏学者，我则两端竭焉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33491,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纵笔六言七首 其三","author":"刘克庄","text":"学射必百发中，观棋争三著高。\n画工一洗万马，巨人一钓六鳌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33492,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纵笔六言七首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"古调不同俗调，后儒多异先儒。\n美蔡中郎幼妇，呵郑司农老奴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33493,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纵笔六言七首 其一","author":"刘克庄","text":"少日才高户大，暮年酒圣诗豪。\n且教儿童精选，谁能奴仆命骚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33494,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纵笔六言七首 其四","author":"刘克庄","text":"读过书皆遗忘，老来诗愈颠狂。\n不献贵人夹袋，尽入奚奴锦囊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":33495,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纵笔六言二首 其二","author":"刘克庄","text":"蒯郦提趋沸汤，